# Frontend Conventions

- Strict TypeScript — no `any`
- Functional components only
- React Query for all server state (hooks in `lib/hooks.ts`)
- UI labels centralized in `lib/labels.ts`
- shadcn/ui components from `@/components/ui/`
- **All user-facing text in Swedish**
- Minimum font size `text-xs` — never use `text-[10px]` or `text-[11px]`
- Buttons sized for easy clicking (min `py-2.5`)
- Card style: `rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 bg-white shadow-sm`

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hardcoded English, tiny text
<p className="text-[10px]">No cases found</p>

// ✅ GOOD — Swedish, readable size
<p className="text-sm text-slate-400">Inga ärenden hittades</p>
```
